        "original_id": "ded23f54-bf99-5f73-8568-b7af2f4d41ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robin Hood, Robin of Locksley, Sean Maguire, Tom Ellis\n- TV Series: Once Upon a Time, EastEnders, Miranda\n- Roles: fictional character, actor, singer, series regular\n\nFacts:\n- Robin of Locksley, later known as Robin Hood, is a fictional character in ABC's television series Once Upon a Time.\n- In the second season of Once Upon a Time, Tom Ellis first played Robin Hood in the series.\n- Scheduling conflicts prevented Tom Ellis from reprising the role of Robin Hood in Once Upon a Time.\n- After Tom Ellis, Sean Maguire took over the role of Robin Hood in Once Upon a Time.\n- Sean Maguire portrayed Robin Hood in recurring appearances during the third and fourth seasons of Once Upon a Time.\n- Sean Maguire became a series regular in the fifth season of Once Upon a Time.\n- Tom Ellis was born on 17 November 1978.\n- Tom Ellis is a Welsh actor.\n- Tom Ellis is known for playing Dr. Oliver Cousins in the BBC One soap opera EastEnders.\n- Tom Ellis is also known for playing Gary Preston in Miranda.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "c372ffa5-a250-5e1e-83d7-d3a4558c7573",
        "text": "Page: Robin Hood (Once Upon a Time). Sentence: Robin of Locksley, later known as Robin Hood, is a fictional character in ABC's television series \"Once Upon a Time\".\nPage: Robin Hood (Once Upon a Time). Sentence: He is portrayed by British actor/singer Sean Maguire, who became a series regular in the fifth season after making recurring appearances in the third and fourth season.\nPage: Robin Hood (Once Upon a Time). Sentence: He is the second actor to play the role in the series, as it was first played by Tom Ellis in the second season, but scheduling conflicts prevented Ellis from reprising the role, resulting in Maguire taking the role afterwards.\nPage: Tom Ellis (actor). Sentence: Tom Ellis (born 17 November 1978) is a Welsh actor, known for playing Dr. Oliver Cousins in the BBC One soap opera \"EastEnders\" and as Gary Preston in \"Miranda.\"",
